#3704
chest cache smuggler ironbound~
a smuggler's ironbound cache~
A low ironbound cache sits against the dry stone.~
Thick oak planks, iron straps, and a municipal-style lock protect this
old smuggler cache. The outside is stained by minerals and hidden
beneath remnants of rotted canvas.
~
